hifiberryos-meta (0.13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * hbos-full: drop hifiberry-librespot and hifiberry-shairport. Both are
    now published as extensions, installed on demand from the web
    interface. With this, no player ships in the bundle except mpd and
    RAAT: a fresh full install has neither Spotify Connect nor AirPlay
    until the user adds them.
    As before, this does not uninstall anything from existing systems --
    apt leaves an installed package in place when a dependency is dropped,
    though `apt autoremove` may then offer to remove it.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 13:30:00 +0000

hifiberryos-meta (0.12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * hbos-full: drop hifiberry-sendspin, hifiberry-squeezelite and
    hifiberry-analog-recognition. All three are now published as
    extensions, installable on demand from the web interface, so a full
    install no longer ships players the user may never enable.
    Note this does not uninstall them from existing systems: apt leaves an
    installed package in place when a dependency is dropped, though it may
    then be flagged by `apt autoremove`.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:00:00 +0000

