hifiberryos-meta (0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Updated hifiberry-audiocontrol to 0.6.11:
    - Added REST endpoints to pause/stop all players with fallback support
    - Updated API documentation for new endpoints
    - Improved volume control initialization with retry mechanism
  * Updated hifiberry-librespot to 0.7.1.2:
    - Converted to per-user systemd service architecture
    - Migrated from system service to user session runtime
    - Enhanced integration with user pipewire service
    - Build optimizations to avoid /tmp usage
  * Updated hifiberry-mpd to 0.24.5.2:
    - Added mpd-set-permissions script for ACL management
    - Fixed MPD directory permissions and audio group ownership
    - Added manual pages for custom scripts
    - Enhanced systemctl integration in maintainer scripts
  * Updated hifiberry-raat to 1.1.43.14:
    - Migrated to systemd user service from system service
    - Updated for Debian 13 Trixie compatibility
    - Enhanced hardware detection with --no-eeprom flag support
  * Updated hifiberry-shairport to 5.0.0.4:
    - Improved postinst script ordering for directory creation
    - Enhanced system user setup reliability during installation
    - Fixed directory creation sequence to prevent warnings
  * Updated hifiberry-squeezelite to 2.0.0.1542:
    - Improved systemd service integration with debhelper
    - Enhanced upgrade detection and service state preservation
    - Refactored maintainer scripts following Debian best practices

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Mon, 30 Sep 2025 14:00:00 +0000

